# ── Cloudflare Turnstile (required for Sign Up / Sign In CAPTCHA) ──
# Get the Site Key from the Cloudflare dashboard (Turnstile > Widgets).
# This key MUST match the site key configured in Supabase Auth > CAPTCHA settings,
# otherwise supabase.auth.signUp() / signInWithPassword() calls that send
# `options: { captchaToken }` will be rejected.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAAAEeWeQHuqgMoh8cd
